<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Thursday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,565.50 (1,564.20)	CHF  1,061.40 (1,061.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    911.18 (912.98)	  GBP  2,539.20 (2,534.50)</p>
<p>    ATS    129.47 (129.69)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought   $44.87 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold     $35.04 million</p>
<p>Total turnover $79.91 million ($64.86 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569; 981 4145</p>
